{
 "code": "RO",
 "model": "gpt-4.1-2025-04-14",
 "body": "<div id=\"wrf26\" class=\"wrf26\" lang=\"da\" data-until=\"2026-11-30T00:00:00+01:00\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"wrf26.css\">\n\n<!-- HERO -->\n<section class=\"w-hero\" id=\"intro\">\n<div class=\"w-hero-in\">\n\n<div class=\"w-hero-h\">\n  <p class=\"w-k\" data-r>Westpack prezintă</p>\n  <h2 class=\"w-h1\" data-r>World Record<br><s>Black</s> Friday</h2>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"w-hero-t\">\n  <p class=\"w-said\" data-r>„Deci încă nu țineți Black Friday?”</p>\n  <p class=\"w-ans\" data-r>Nu, am încercat în schimb să doborâm recorduri mondiale. Probabil că am fost puțin prea ambițioși…</p>\n  <p class=\"w-lead\" data-r>Patru colegi au încercat fiecare propriul record, iar noi bineînțeles am filmat totul. Niciunul dintre recordurile mondiale oficiale nu a fost doborât, dar am obținut cinci videoclipuri și puțin mai mult respect pentru cei care fac asta profesionist. Vezi tu însuți cum a fost.</p>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"w-hero-v\" data-r>\n  <figure class=\"w-vid\" data-v=\"1247537412\" data-h=\"2193656689\" data-title=\"@@C0@@\">\n    <button type=\"button\" class=\"w-play\" aria-label=\"Vezi intro-ul, 0:49\">\n      <img src=\"https://d3k81ch9hvuctc.cloudfront.net/company/VRPp5S/images/43e7efd4-41d9-43a0-8967-b667f64453b1.jpeg\" alt=\"Prezentatoarea în depozit, în fața paleților cu cutii Westpack\" width=\"720\" height=\"900\" loading=\"lazy\">\n      <span class=\"w-pm\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><i></i><span>Vezi intro-ul<em>0:49</em></span></span>\n    </button>\n  </figure>\n  <p class=\"w-cap\">Prezentatoarea a rezumat foarte bine: <b>“There were questionable techniques, definitely.”</b></p>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"w-roster\">\n  <p class=\"w-k\">Patru încercări, patru rezultate</p>\n  <ol class=\"w-rl\">\n    <li>\n      <a href=\"#martin\">\n        <img src=\"https://d3k81ch9hvuctc.cloudfront.net/company/VRPp5S/images/c157394c-78b0-4b20-ab65-e54c1b7f7528.jpeg\" alt=\"Martin\" width=\"400\" height=\"480\" loading=\"lazy\">\n        <span class=\"w-rt\"><span class=\"w-rn\"><small>01</small>Martin</span><span class=\"w-rr\">12</span><span class=\"w-ru\">cutii într-un singur turn</span><span class=\"w-rc\">Record: niciunul</span></span>\n      </a>\n    </li>\n    <li>\n      <a href=\"#mia\">\n        <img src=\"https://d3k81ch9hvuctc.cloudfront.net/company/VRPp5S/images/016d324d-0cad-4998-8f4b-96cbce5aa3e2.jpeg\" alt=\"Mia\" width=\"400\" height=\"480\" loading=\"lazy\">\n        <span class=\"w-rt\"><span class=\"w-rn\"><small>02</small>Mia</span><span class=\"w-rr\">18</span><span class=\"w-ru\">M&M’s într-un minut</span><span class=\"w-rc\">Record: 65</span></span>\n      </a>\n    </li>\n    <li>\n      <a href=\"#cecilia\">\n        <img src=\"https://d3k81ch9hvuctc.cloudfront.net/company/VRPp5S/images/d02498c9-2f1e-4ace-bee7-79a1238b1ca3.jpeg\" alt=\"Cecilia\" width=\"400\" height=\"480\" loading=\"lazy\">\n        <span class=\"w-rt\"><span class=\"w-rn\"><small>03</small>Cecilia</span><span class=\"w-rr\">6,5<small>m</small></span><span class=\"w-ru\">tragere cu elasticul în depozit</span><span class=\"w-rc\">Record: 30,16 m</span></span>\n      </a>\n    </li>\n    <li>\n      <a href=\"#niklas\">\n        <img src=\"https://d3k81ch9hvuctc.cloudfront.net/company/VRPp5S/images/29e22141-2231-44a3-96e9-09c3184e6c17.jpeg\" alt=\"Niklas\" width=\"400\" height=\"480\" loading=\"lazy\">\n        <span class=\"w-rt\"><span class=\"w-rn\"><small>04</small>Niklas</span><span class=\"w-rr\">52</span><span class=\"w-ru\">clame de rufe pe față</span><span class=\"w-rc\">Record: 161</span></span>\n      </a>\n    </li>\n  </ol>\n  <p class=\"w-hint\">Alege un concurent și vezi cum a decurs încercarea.</p>\n</div>\n\n</div>\n</section>\n\n<!-- MARTIN -->\n<section class=\"w-p\" id=\"martin\">\n<div class=\"w-p-in\">\n\n<header class=\"w-p-h\" data-r>\n  <span class=\"w-bgn\" aria-hidden=\"true\">01</span>\n  <p class=\"w-k\">Concurent 01</p>\n  <h2 class=\"w-name\">Martin</h2>\n  <p class=\"w-nick\">Maestrul turn